s/functional-spec/test-contract.md-6-contract for what such a test must have, what it must not do, what it should do,\n--\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-111-### 1.7 A 10-second floor on explicit I/O timeouts\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-112-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-113-Every explicit connection, request, read, socket, server, client, process,\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-114-database, messaging, or HTTP timeout is at least 10 seconds. Shorter timeouts\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-115-are flaky under native-image-agent metadata generation and Native Image\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md:116:startup; unbounded waits remain forbidden (§FS-test-contract.1.6).\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-117-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-118-```java\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-119-// Bad: fine on a warm JVM, flaky under the native-image agent\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-120-config.setConnectTimeout(Duration.ofSeconds(2));\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-121-\n--\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-172-library or dependency API types in their real packages. If a needed API is\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-173-missing from the test classpath, add the correct test dependency or leave the\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-174-feature untested with an explanation.\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-175-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-176-```java\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md:177:// Bad: a hand-written stand-in for a missing optional dependency\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-178-package com.acme.codec;             // the dependency's real package\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-179-public class Codec { /* stub */ }   // shadows the real type at compile time\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-180-```\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-181-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-182-### 2.4 No no-op satisfaction of metadata req