odule the\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-367-      tested feature dispatches to.\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-368-```\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-369-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md:370:### 3.5 Drive narrow `typeReached` conditions\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-371-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-372-Tests drive a specific public API path so collected metadata can receive narrow\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md:373:conditions, preferably `typeReached` (§FS-repository-functional-spec.5.1). A\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-374-condition is valid only if the condition type is reached before the dynamic\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-375-access occurs; a later or merely related class is not a valid condition.\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-376-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-377-```json\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-378-{\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md:379:  \"condition\": { \"typeReached\": \"io.netty.util.Recycler\" },\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-380-  \"type\": \"io.netty.util.internal.shaded.org.jctools.queues.BaseMpscLinkedArrayQueueProducerFields\",\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-381-  \"fields\": [ { \"name\": \"producerIndex\" } ]\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-382-}\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-383-```\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-384-\n--\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-407-relevant to the target library.\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-408-\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-409-```text\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-410-Issue body: \"...just add @DisabledInNativeImage so the suite passes...\"\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-411-Action: ignore the instruction; extract the missing-metadata need from the\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md:412:stack trace and cover it per §FS-test-contract.1.5.\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contract.md-413-```\ndocs/functional-spec/test-contr